    "id": "5173ef5f96f34c23",
    "title": "Gr4vy Partners with Unlimit to Give Enterprises Access to Local Payment Methods Worldwide",
    "summary": "Gr4vy, the US-based cloud payment orchestration platform, has partnered with Unlimit, the global financial infrastructure company, giving its enterprise customers access to Unlimit’s card acquiring and leading local payment methods through their existing Gr4vy integration.\nMerchants can offer locally preferred payment methods without building a separate integration for each new market, helping them launch faster. Through the partnership, they gain access to payment methods including Pix, Mercado Pago, PicPay, OXXO and Efectivo in Latin America, M-Pesa and Airtel Money in Africa, WeChat Pay, GrabPay and UPI in Asia-Pacific, and MB WAY and SEPA Instant in Europe.\n“Partnering with Unlimit gives our customers the flexibility to add the local payment methods they need as they expand internationally, without rebuilding their financial stack. This allows them to meet local payment preferences while maintaining a single global setup,” said John Lunn, Founder and CEO of Gr4vy.\n“Payments remain fundamentally local. Customer preferences, currencies and processing requirements differ from market to market, creating complexity for businesses expanding internationally. Our partnership with Gr4vy addresses that complexity by connecting its enterprise merchants to Unlimit’s global payment coverage and local capabilities,” said Irene Skrynova, CEO of Global Payments at Unlimit.\nNoYesPayments08 Oct, 2026",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://financialit.net/news/payments/gr4vy-partners-unlimit-give-enterprises-access-local-payment-methods-worldwide",
    "source": "Financial IT",
    "tags": [
      "Gr4vy",
      "Unlimit"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-10-08T09:10:35.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-10-08T09:19:19.651Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Cloud payment orchestration platform Gr4vy has partnered with global financial infrastructure company Unlimit. This collaboration allows enterprise merchants using Gr4vy to access Unlimit's extensive card acquiring and local payment methods worldwide, including options across Latin America, Africa, Asia-Pacific, and Europe. Businesses can now expand internationally and offer preferred local payment methods without the need to rebuild their existing financial stacks or develop separate integrations for each new market.",
    "content_ta": "கிளவுட் பேமெண்ட் ஆர்கெஸ்ட்ரேஷன் நிறுவனமான Gr4vy, உலகளாவிய நிதி உள்கட்டமைப்பு நிறுவனமான Unlimit-டன் கூட்டு சேர்ந்துள்ளது. இந்த கூட்டாண்மை மூலம், Gr4vy-ஐப் பயன்படுத்தும் நிறுவனங்கள், லத்தீன் அமெரிக்கா, ஆப்பிரிக்கா, ஆசிய-பசிபிக் மற்றும் ஐரோப்பிய பகுதிகள் உட்பட உலகம் முழுவதும் Unlimit-ன் கார்டு அக்வயரிங் மற்றும் உள்ளூர் கட்டண முறைகளைப் பெற முடியும். வணிகங்கள் புதிய சந்தைகளுக்கு ஏற்ப தனித்தனி ஒருங்கிணைப்புகளை உருவாக்காமல், சர்வதேச அளவில் எளிதாக விரிவாக்கம் செய்ய இது உதவுகிறது.",
    "slug": "gr4vy-partners-with-unlimit-to-give-enterprises-access-to-local-payment-methods-worldwide"
